<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:46:20 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>尊重室友的巫术实践</title><link>https://some.pics/6afa6e79c6d18</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你的巫术可以尊重与你同住的人。如果室友不喜欢熏香，你可以不点燃任何东西而说出祝福。这种调整体现了对你自己的修行和你们共同居所的关怀。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted fantasy cottage interior in charcoal and muted rose, with a witch blessing an open doorway beside a comfortably reading housemate. Lily-pad stepping stones cross blue-green water toward a cottage on a giant lily pad. Ivory serif lettering fills the upper wall, and a gold emblem watermark appears at bottom-right. Text: Your witchcraft can respect the people you live with. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6afa6e79c6d18.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:46:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日天空</title><link>https://some.pics/6afa4243b6d9d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今日天空&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Light wispy clouds streaking across a pale blue sky." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6afa4243b6d9d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:37:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>暗眼灯草鹀</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9fbc34c24b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只暗眼灯草鹀。我以前从未见过这些，不得不查了一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A dark gray bird with a white chest and white beak" height="1280" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6af9fbc34c24b.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:36:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>两颗心</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9e9dbacc05</link><description>&lt;p&gt;两颗心&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two hearts drawn on a black surface through a thin layer of ice. A larger heart and a smaller one, rotated by 90 degrees, next to it.  The title could refer to the song of the same name by Phil Collins, Chris Isaak or Stacey Q, depending on how old one is and what sort of music one listened to back then. " height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6af9e9dbacc05.jpg" width="3449"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:20:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>慕尼黑狮子餐厅早午餐</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9ca9a665e9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;慕尼黑狮子餐厅早午餐。自制饼干配培根肉汁和芝士炒蛋。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Wide angle view of Amy's back, facing the sink. To her right two pans of homemade biscuits on the counter. To her left on the glass stovetop is the homemade bacon gravy and the scrambled eggs are just out of view." height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/duggan/6af9ca9a665e9.jpg" width="4080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://duggan.some.pics"&gt;@duggan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:07:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>灰天偶现晴空美</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9b04fafd93</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这是一个灰蒙蒙的日子，但有时阳光穿透云层，天空变得如此美丽。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A landscape with a large church and gorgeous sky " height="2072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sylvia/6af9b04fafd93.jpg" width="2072"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sylvia.some.pics"&gt;@sylvia&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:14:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11月15日运势：财务与机遇</title><link>https://some.pics/6af996eb285a0</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日簿 · 2026年11月15日
阅读：方块十
有利焦点：将财务机会转化为更稳定的收入；为停滞的计划争取稳妥的批准；加强能够重新开启机会的人脉联系
包含辅助时机窗口。

日簿：https://mizjeannie.com/daybook&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Daybook for November 15, 2026: an illustrated Ten of Diamonds, the daily reading, three favored magical focuses and their supporting timing windows." height="1600" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af996eb285a0.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:26:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日对应：2026年11月15日</title><link>https://some.pics/6af9921298159</link><description>&lt;p&gt;**今日对应 — 2026年11月15日**

黄金 · 黄水晶 · 薄荷

&lt;a href="https://mizjeannie.com/almanac"&gt;在Miz Jeannie上规划这一天 →&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Today's Correspondences for November 15, 2026. Color: Gold — clarity, study, prosperity, success. Crystal: Citrine — prosperity, clarity, confidence, success. Herb: Peppermint (Mentha × piperita) — clarity, prosperity, healing, communication. The graphic also explains why each fits today's almanac context." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af9921298159.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:05:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>墨西哥街头塔可餐车</title><link>https://some.pics/6af985329aa17</link><description>&lt;p&gt;墨西哥美食车！街头塔可真是让人爱不释手。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two crispy corn tostadas topped with seasoned ground beef, green salsa, diced white onion, and cilantro sit on a glass plate beside a fresh lime." height="3765" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6af985329aa17.jpg" width="2824"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:11:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>不必过度解读巧合</title><link>https://some.pics/6af92b001f595</link><description>&lt;p&gt;不是每个巧合都需要赋予神奇的意义。如果你连续几个早晨看到同一只鸟，你可以享受观察它的过程，而不必认定这是什么征兆。 practicing witchcraft并不意味着你必须解读一切。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Painted storybook witch with a breakfast mug watches a brown sparrow at an open window. Rose-pink curtains frame a railway curving upward through clouds, with ivory lettering on charcoal walls and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: Not every coincidence needs a magical meaning. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6af92b001f595.jpg" width="1024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:46:10 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>